//! The flash key `rom`, the default: the kernel writes no flash register,
//! and the cache reads the flash as the mask ROM left it, `03h` on one line
//! at divide by 4 of the memory-SPI core clock.
//!
//! One of the `s3flash` modules, mapped by a case's `flash_key` (the runner)
//! or an image's `[keys]` (`sosimage`). The HAL's `clock_init` calls its
//! `flash_init` after the clock key's (`../../kernel/lib.saw`;
//! `../../ABI.md` §18d).

/// Switch the flash's reads for this image: none, so nothing is written.
public func flash_init() unsafe { }
